OL,3,GNEWSAAsylum seekers set to move out of
OL,4,Ahotel, says MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hotel in Southampton will stop
OL,7,Fhousing asylum seekers in the coming
OL,8,Fmonths, an MP has said.
OL,10,FSatvir Kaur, Labour MP for Southampton
OL,11,FTest, said Highfield House Hotel in
OL,12,FPortswood will be closing as an asylum
OL,13,Fhotel, although further details of the
OL,14,Fclosure have yet to be announced.
OL,16,FThe hotel has been used by the Home
OL,17,FOffice to accommodate asylum seekers
OL,18,Fawaiting decisions on their claims. It
OL,19,Fhas been the focus of regular
OL,20,Fanti-immigration protests alongside
OL,21,Fcounter-demonstrations.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
