OL,3,GNEWSAAsylum seekers set to move out of
OL,4,Ahotel, says MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the Home Office said
OL,7,Fit is closing every asylum hotel and
OL,8,Fmoving asylum seekers into alternative
OL,9,Faccommodation, including former
OL,10,Fmilitary sites.
